    comment "en" """
        Source X3488 = Swedish ICD-10-SE national extension of X34 SNOMED CT 698720003 (Athena ICD10
        concept 45575988), refined by Swedish external-cause metadata: place=annan specificerad plats /
        andra specificerade platser (other specified place); activity=andra specificerade aktiviteter
        (other specified activities). The clinical event/exposure is unchanged; the Swedish
        place/activity qualifiers are external-cause metadata with no distinct standard SNOMED CT clinical
        analogue. Target SNOMED CT 44784554 = sctid 698720003. Why this target: Athena ICD10 crosswalk maps
        base X34 (concept_id 45575988) -> 44784554 (relationship 45575988, 44784554); it is the
        authoritative standard concept for X34 and fully subsumes every place/activity-specific SE
        subdivision. mapping_type=broader (target fully contains every clinical meaning of the source;
        the dropped qualifier is breadth-neutral external-cause metadata, not a partial slice).
        Confidence (high): verified Athena crosswalk on the base code with a small, well-understood
        one-level breadth mismatch (the SE place/activity refinement is lost). Athena-local research
        only.
        """
}
